{"id":"n26643-3-7","stage":2,"title":"우습다 · 不在话下","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26643-3-7-1","ko":"너 지금 내 말이 우습니?","zh":"你现在是在觉得我说的话很可笑吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우습니?","meaning":"不在话下，看不起","explanation":"우습다：不在话下，看不起；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"우습다","audio":"/audio/995805982ccb8b41582b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26643","senseId":"3","lemma":"우습다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"995805982ccb8b41","term":"우습다","zh":"不在话下，看不起","audio":"/audio/995805982ccb8b41582b.mp3","entryId":"26643","definition":"不重视或微不足道。","pronunciation":["우ː습따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c7aec9e2967f06442181.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26643-3-7-2","ko":"그런 거 아니야. 이제 네 말대로 하려던 참이었어.","zh":"不是那样的。我正打算按你说的来做呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말대로","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；대로：表示“按照、就……而言、各自”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려던","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；려던：表示过去正打算做的动作，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참이었어.","meaning":"计划，准备","explanation":"참：计划，准备；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71466","senseId":"2","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"计划，准备","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71466","definition":"做某事的想法或打算。","pronunciation":["참ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/293e29677b7b7f1f93d8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.43,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26643","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你现在是在觉得我说的话很可笑吗？","不是那样的。我正打算按你说的来做呢。","公司附近有干净又便宜的公寓吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你现在是在觉得我说的话很可笑吗？","不是那样的。我正打算按你说的来做呢。","公司附近有干净又便宜的公寓吗？"],"answer"